WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t3-04-perfectionism-release.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.610
The work is complete.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.750
Yet you cannot bring yourself to release it.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.370
Or perhaps you are staring at someone else's feedback.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.910
Reading between the lines four times over.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:22.130
To locate the hidden critique.

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:31.620
Either way, an absolute standard has been set.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:35.770
And your effort is being subjected to endless trial.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.100
Your instinct reacts with immediate tension.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.250
While the grounded perspective that sees the bigger picture

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.250
Take longer to speak up.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:04.950
Almost all of your mental fatigue comes from staying stuck in the space.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.440
Where those two forces collide.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:11.600
Four structured milestones will guide us through this.

phase-recognise
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:13.040
Recognise

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:18.630
We begin by identifying where this rigid pressure lodges in your body.

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:22.540
Feel the somatic signature of perfectionism.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.380
A high tight constriction across the chest

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.910
Punched jaws, hike shoulders.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:34.270
Or a subtle twitching in your hands pushing you to alter something one more
time.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.950
Give this physical tension a single word.

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.250
Advertated

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.640
Now ask one clarifying question

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.100
Who standard is driving this state?

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.380
Is it an internal bar you set for yourself when no one else asked for it?

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:02.750
Or is it an external demand?

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:07.370
A formal review, a manager's note or a public expectation.

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:17.230
Both options converge in the same physical discomfort.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:21.880
But distinguishing them clarifies what you are actually resisting.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:24.080
Go one layer deeper.

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.510
Beneath the pursuit of perfection

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.030
Lies the feared consequence of falling short.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.810
Not just the practical outcome.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:36.900
But what a flaw would mean about your core value.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:40.370
Look closely at the primary driver underneath.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.300
Losing control of your reputation

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.970
Being exposed as incompetent

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.450
Carrying the blame for failure

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:51.770
Or running out of time to build something that lasts.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.490
Sink into that underlying vulnerability.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:02.410
Leave it right where it is.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:04.920
Nothing needs to be solved here.

phase-regulate
00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:16.410
Regulate, now we adjust your physiology to soften this rigid grip.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:27.450
Inhale for four counts.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.930
An exhale for 6 counts

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.750
Keep the breath out longer and smoother than the breath in.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.890
Bring your focal point directly into the center of your chest.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.870
If you are sitting at your work right now physically step back

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.670
Take your hands off the keyboard or page.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.410
Drop your shoulders away from your ears.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.290
And let your jaw loosen.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:20.550
Urgent thoughts in system on revision will spike.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.850
Let each thought surface without acting on it or obeying its command.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:43.000
An arising thought is just an impulse moving through the nervous system.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.480
It is not a directive to edit.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:50.020
If you catch yourself trying hard to relax, ease off your effort.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.880
Striving is just perfectionism.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.540
Trying to master relaxation.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.430
Rest here in this quiet breathing space.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.840
Whether passes through a room

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.350
But the room remains undisturbed.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.610
There are two separate dynamics occurring right now.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.730
There is the standard itself.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.590
Which may be high for valid professional reasons.

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:44.360
And is not inherently the problem.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.170
And there is the compulsiveness

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:55.450
Rechecking work that is already finished.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:58.190
Overanalyzing a minor note

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.410
Or rewriting a sentence

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.480
You finalized yesterday.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.660
Ask yourself directly.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.240
What will one more pass reveal that the previous three missed?

phase-release
00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.150
Release

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.570
The honest answer is nothing.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:17.490
You already know this intellectually, yet the urge to polish continues.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:28.370
That is because the compulsion isn't seeking quality.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.850
It is seeking a sense of absolute safety.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.790
That it can never ground.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:47.310
There is no level of polish that will make your nervous system feel completely
immune to critique.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:55.660
Keep your high standards.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.500
But lay down the compulsion to recheck.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.780
Ask yourself this question.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.730
What was this relentless refining built to protect?

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:14.130
Perfect execution was once an effective shield.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.560
Somewhere in your past

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:25.860
Ensuring that no flaw could be found.

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:29.720
Was the only way to avoid criticism or rejection.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.970
Acknowledge the distinction between quality and compulsive checking.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.230
The standard is a conscious measure of craft.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.650
The compulsion is a desperate search for security.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.390
You don't need to lower your bar.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:01.870
Only drop the search for impossible certainty.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:11.860
Put the primary fear that surfaced into your breath stream.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:13.230
And let it be.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:24.810
If it was the fear of being blamed, realize that endless checking.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:27.800
Will not control how others interpret your work.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.450
None of this gets settled from inside the compulsion.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:40.750
Bryce

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:44.310
Finally, we step into decisive completion.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.500
Visualize yourself from across the room.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.360
Hands resting away from the work.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.790
Letting it stand as it is.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.190
It is complete enough to release.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:02.680
Even if your anxiety disagrees.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:15.190
Now picture the version of yourself you want to embody when the urge to
re-check strikes next.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:19.130
Same high standards, same internal itch.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.570
But you are the one deciding where your focus goes.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.460
Not on one more pass.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.820
But on a clear clean decision.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:37.910
Submit the file, send the email, accept the feedback for what it is.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.840
I moved to the next task.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.150
Where are you sitting?

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.740
What is the physical action of releasing the work?

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.270
Step directly into that decisive move.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.090
The itch to polish may remain.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.480
But your focus belongs to you.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:09.480
Pick one specific moment to release your work cleanly next time.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:18.700
Afterwards,

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.600
Right down what shifted.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.600
Take one last slow breath

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.830
In for four, and out for six.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:27.130
Feel the floor beneath you.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.490
Gently move your hands and feet.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.050
And open your eyes when you are ready.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:37.280
Return to this anchor whenever you need to choose execution.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.420
Over endless refinement.
